            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij kod, aby funkcja działała zgodnie z oczekiwaniami.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"typescript.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"greet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"greet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Miriam&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello, Miriam!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>name</code>, następnie <code>:</code>, a potem <code>string</code>, <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 131136,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czym jest enum w TypeScript?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Enum to sposób definiowania zestawu nazwanych stałych</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Enum to sposób definiowania klasy</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Enum to sposób definiowania interfejsu</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Enum to sposób definiowania zestawu nazwanych stałych.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 131117,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj prawidłowy typ zwracany przez funkcję.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"typescript.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  greet(): \" /><text value=\"void\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello. I'm &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Person(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Pia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person.greet();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"boolean\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Hello. I'm Pia!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>void</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
